# Browser
# What a defender sees of Academic Dispute (CR 509.1c): Bot2's Llanowar Elves attacks on turn 4, and in the declare attackers step
# Bot1 casts Academic Dispute on their own Monastery Swiftspear. Bot1's page is asked whether it gains reach (yes), then the
# discard of Learn (declined) and the Lesson from outside the game (declined). The Swiftspear's face says it blocks this turn if able
# and has Reach; the blockers dock says it must block the Elves and holds its button until it does (its No blocks button is disabled, and the engine refuses no blocks); Bot1 blocks, and the Elves die.

